{"c":[{"name":"20260919T173934Z-80f0ac884170d4c1","text":"Caret keeps five upstreams: KeyType, GhostType, Computer Use Jev, Skyvern and Screenpipe. docs/input-pipeline.md defines the proposed shared Jev/context/workflow handoff; the current action UI does not call the Python CLI.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T174647Z-c6a318f44bd68335","text":"Screenpipe history for Caret is sidecar plus facade (last N minutes/windows); do not vendor current engine or inherit TCC from their CLI","type":"note"}]}
